#X text 240 83 The object converts a tempo value in BPM (beats per
minute) to a beat period in milliseconds. The conversion is simply
(60 / BPM) * 1000 \, but the object makes the patch more readable and
self-documenting. The result can be used \, for example \, to drive
a metro or a delay line that is synchronized with the musical tempo.;
